sequenceDiagram
    actor "Flutter Mobile Client" as FlutterMobileClient
    participant "ASP.NET Core Backend" as ASPNETCoreBackend
    participant "Polly Resilience Policy" as PollyResiliencePolicy
    participant "Google Books API" as GoogleBooksAPI

    ASPNETCoreBackend->>GoogleBooksAPI: 1. Initial requests fail, tripping the circuit breaker
    activate PollyResiliencePolicy
    ASPNETCoreBackend->>PollyResiliencePolicy: 1.1. ExecuteAsync(apiCall)
    PollyResiliencePolicy-->>ASPNETCoreBackend: Failure Response
    activate GoogleBooksAPI
    PollyResiliencePolicy->>GoogleBooksAPI: 1.2. GET /books/v1/volumes?q=isbn:...
    GoogleBooksAPI-->>PollyResiliencePolicy: 503 Service Unavailable
    PollyResiliencePolicy->>PollyResiliencePolicy: 2. Circuit state transitions to 'Open'
    activate ASPNETCoreBackend
    FlutterMobileClient->>ASPNETCoreBackend: 3. GET /api/v1/books/search?isbn=978-0321765723
    ASPNETCoreBackend-->>FlutterMobileClient: 424 Failed Dependency with fallback payload
    ASPNETCoreBackend->>PollyResiliencePolicy: 4. ExecuteAsync(apiCall)
    PollyResiliencePolicy-->>ASPNETCoreBackend: Throws BrokenCircuitException
    ASPNETCoreBackend->>ASPNETCoreBackend: 5. Catch BrokenCircuitException and execute fallback logic
    FlutterMobileClient->>FlutterMobileClient: 6. Render manual entry form
    PollyResiliencePolicy->>PollyResiliencePolicy: 7. After break duration, circuit transitions to 'Half-Open'

    note over PollyResiliencePolicy: The transition to 'Half-Open' state and the subsequent trial request are critical for automatic r...

    deactivate ASPNETCoreBackend
    deactivate GoogleBooksAPI
    deactivate PollyResiliencePolicy
